,"deletions":56,"truncated":false},{"path":"dev/breeze/doc/ci/04_selective_checks.md","lines":["@@ -525,6 +525,15 @@ together using `pytest-xdist` (pytest-xdist distributes the tests among parallel"," * `TS SDK unit tests` (the vitest suite run by `pnpm test` in `ts-sdk/`, exposed as the","   `run-ts-sdk-tests` output) run when `TS SDK files` change: anything under `ts-sdk/` except `.md`","   files, `ts-sdk/api-docs/`, and `ts-sdk/docs/` (the docs toolchain's own package).","+* `Lang SDK serialization conformance` (the `tests-lang-sdk-conformance` job, which serializes the Dags","+  of `scripts/ci/lang_sdk_serialization/test_dags.yaml` with an SDK and with Airflow and compares the","+  two) runs for each SDK listed in the `lang-sdk-conformance-sdks` output: `go` when `Go SDK","+  conformance files` change, `java` when `Java SDK conformance files` change and `ts` when `TS SDK","+  conformance files` change. Each group is the SDK's own files (as in `Go SDK files`, `Java SDK files`","+  and `TS SDK files`) plus what the check compares the SDK against: Airflow's serializer","+  (`serialized_objects.py`), `airflow-core/src/airflow/serialization/schema.json` and the shared","+  harness under `scripts/ci/lang_sdk_serialization/`. None of those three forces `full_tests_needed`,","+  so a change to any of them runs the check for every SDK. The list is empty on a component branch."," * `Java SDK E2E tests` (the `java_sdk` mode of the deployed-stack tests, exposed as the","   `run-java-sdk-e2e-tests` output) run when the Java SDK sources (`java-sdk/`, excluding `.md`), the","   Java test-fixture and native-Dag bundles (`airflow-e2e-tests/java-test-bundle/`,","@@ -614,18 +623,14 @@ when some files are not changed. Those are the rules implemented:","     `regenerate-java-sdk-verification-metadata` checks are skipped. All three run the java-sdk","     Gradle wrapper, and `regenerate-java-sdk-verification-metadata` also resolves the whole Java","     SDK dependency graph from Maven Central","-  * if no `Java SDK conformance files` changed - `check-java-sdk-serialization-conformance`","-    and `sync-java-sdk-dag-schema` are skipped (`check-java-sdk-serialization-conformance`","-    compiles the Java SDK with Gradle and resolves its dependencies from Maven Central, and","-    `sync-java-sdk-dag-schema` runs the `:sdk:syncDagSchema` Gradle task). The group is wider","-    than `Java SDK files`. It also covers Airflow's serializer (`serialized_objects.py`),","-    `airflow-core/src/airflow/serialization/schema.json` and the shared harness under","-    `scripts/ci/lang_sdk_serialization/`. These files are in the group because the conformance","-    check compares the SDK against them, and none of them forces `full_tests_needed`. Because","-    airflow-core's `schema.json` is in the group, `sync-java-sdk-dag-schema` still runs on a PR","-    that changes only that file. Such a change is what leaves the Java SDK's copy in","+  * if no `Java SDK conformance files` changed - `sync-java-sdk-dag-schema` is skipped (it runs the","+    `:sdk:syncDagSchema` Gradle task). The group is wider than `Java SDK files`: it also covers","+    Airflow's serializer, `airflow-core/src/airflow/serialization/schema.json` and the shared","+    harness under `scripts/ci/lang_sdk_serialization/` (see `Lang SDK serialization conformance`","+    above). Because airflow-core's `schema.json` is in the group, `sync-java-sdk-dag-schema` still","+    runs on a PR that changes only that file. Such a change is what leaves the Java SDK's copy in","     `java-sdk/sdk/schema/dag-schema.json` out of date","-  * whichever of the five Java SDK hooks above runs first in a job pays for Gradle's cold","+  * whichever of the four Java SDK hooks above runs first in a job pays for Gradle's cold","     start, which includes downloading the Gradle distribution. A PR skips the cold start only","     when it changes none of the `Java SDK conformance files`","   * neither Java SDK group includes `.pre-commit-config.yaml` or CI setup files. A PR that","@@ -698,6 +703,7 @@ GitHub Actions to pass the list of parameters to a command to execute"," | kubernetes-combos-list-as-string                        | All combinations of Python version and Kubernetes version to use for tests as space-separated string    | 3.11-v1.25.2 3.12-v1.28.13               | *    |"," | kubernetes-versions                                     | All Kubernetes versions to use for tests as JSON array                                                  | \\['v1.25.2'\\]                            |      |"," | kubernetes-versions-list-as-string                      | All Kubernetes versions to use for tests as space-separated string                                      | v1.25.2                                  | *    |","+| lang-sdk-conformance-sdks                               | Language SDKs whose serialization conformance check runs, as JSON array                                 | \\[\"go\", \"java\", \"ts\"\\]                   |      |"," | latest-versions-only                                    | If set, the number of Python, Kubernetes, DB versions will be limited to the latest ones.               | false                                    |      |"," | mypy-checks                                             | List of folders to be considered for mypy checks                                                        | \\[\"airflow_aux\", \"airflow_core\"\\]        |      |"," | mysql-exclude                                           | Which versions of MySQL to exclude for tests as JSON array                                              | []                                       |      |"],"additions":17,"deletions":11,"truncated":false},{"path":"dev/breeze/src/airflow_breeze/utils/selective_checks.py","lines":["@@ -147,9 +147,11 @@ class FileGroupForCi(Enum):","     TASK_SDK_INTEGRATION_TEST_FILES = auto()","     AGENT_FRAMEWORK_FILES = auto()","     GO_SDK_FILES = auto()","+    GO_SDK_CONFORMANCE_FILES = auto()","     JAVA_SDK_FILES = auto()","     JAVA_SDK_CONFORMANCE_FILES = auto()","     TS_SDK_FILES = auto()","+    TS_SDK_CONFORMANCE_FILES = auto()","     TS_SDK_DOCS_FILES = auto()","     AIRFLOW_CTL_FILES = auto()","     AIRFLOW_CTL_INTEGRATION_TEST_FILES = auto()","@@ -217,6 +219,15 @@ def __hash__(self):","     r\"^task-sdk/src/airflow/sdk/importers/.*\","," )"," ","+# What every language SDK's serialization conformance check compares the SDK against: Airflow's","+# serializer and schema, and the shared harness. They do not force full_tests_needed, so each SDK's","+# conformance group lists them next to the SDK's own files.","+LANG_SDK_CONFORMANCE_SHARED_FILES = (","+    r\"^airflow-core/src/airflow/serialization/serialized_objects\\.py$\",","+    r\"^airflow-core/src/airflow/serialization/schema\\.json$\",","+    r\"^scripts/ci/lang_sdk_serialization/.*\",","+)","+"," CI_FILE_GROUP_MATCHES: HashableDict[FileGroupForCi] = HashableDict(","     {","         FileGroupForCi.ENVIRONMENT_FILES: [","@@ -538,6 +549,12 @@ def __hash__(self):","             # everything else (go.mod, go.sum, build config) must trigger the unit tests.","             r\"^go-sdk/(?!.*\\.md$).*\",","         ],","+        FileGroupForCi.GO_SDK_CONFORMANCE_FILES: [","+            # The Go SDK, plus what its serialization conformance check compares it against:","+            # Airflow's serializer and schema, and the shared harness.","+            r\"^go-sdk/(?!.*\\.md$).*\",","+            *LANG_SDK_CONFORMANCE_SHARED_FILES,","+        ],","         FileGroupForCi.JAVA_SDK_FILES: [","             # `.md` excluded — doc-only edits do not affect the Gradle build.","             r\"^java-sdk/(?!.*\\.md$).*\",","@@ -546,9 +563,7 @@ def __hash__(self):","             # The Java SDK, plus what its serialization conformance check compares it against:","             # Airflow's serializer and schema, and the shared harness.","             r\"^java-sdk/(?!.*\\.md$).*\",","-     